7.136000  0.000000  0.000000
0.000000  7.136000  0.000000
0.000000  0.000000  7.136000
ATOMIC_SPECIES
C  12.01099968  C_ONCV_PBE-1.0.upf
N  14.00699997  N_ONCV_PBE-1.0.upf
